  "statement": "The ResponsibilityAgent emphasizes the importance of ethical compliance and accountability in the RollCall system. Requirements RES-01 to RES-07 ensure adherence to data protection regulations, transparency in attendance recording, and the ability for students to dispute records. These are crucial for maintaining fairness and social responsibility. However, I raise concerns regarding EFF-04 and EFF-07, as the focus on generating reports quickly may conflict with the need for anonymization in RES-04. Additionally, the requirement for role-based access control in RES-06 may not align with the high concurrency demands of EFF-02, potentially compromising data security.",
